  - fref("02-research/04-glossary/reentrancy.td")
  - fref("02-research/04-glossary/feature-structure.td")
---

A binary relation $\equiv_F$ over the set of attribute paths in a feature structure $F$. Two paths $\pi$ and $\pi'$ are path-equivalent in $F$, written $\pi \equiv_F \pi'$, if following both from the root of $F$ leads to the same node. The formal way to express reentrancy.
